---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title={'Homelab — Ian Gabriel Sanchez'}
  description={'A self-hosted Proxmox cluster and Raspberry Pi homelab — infrastructure, services, and what runs where.'}
  canonical="/lab"
  active="lab"
  ogType="website"
>
  <!-- ── PAGE HEADER ── -->
  <div class="border-b-3 border-black">
    <div class="px-10 pt-14 pb-10">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Personal Infrastructure</p>
      <h1 class="text-[clamp(48px,6vw,72px)] font-black uppercase leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]">Homelab</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── STATS BAR ── -->
  <div class="bg-black border-b-3 border-black">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="border-r border-white/10 px-10 py-7">
      <div class="text-[40px] font-black text-white leading-none tracking-tight">2</div>
      <div class="text-[10px] text-white/70 uppercase tracking-[.12em] mt-1">Node Cluster</div>
    </div>
    <div class="border-r border-white/10 bg-accent px-10 py-7">
      <div class="text-[40px] font-black text-white leading-none tracking-tight">12+</div>
      <div class="text-[10px] text-white/70 uppercase tracking-[.12em] mt-1">Services Running</div>
    </div>
    <div class="border-r border-white/10 px-10 py-7">
      <div class="text-[40px] font-black text-white leading-none tracking-tight">24/7</div>
      <div class="text-[10px] text-white/70 uppercase tracking-[.12em] mt-1">Mac Mini + Pi Uptime</div>
    </div>
    <div class="px-10 py-7">
      <div class="text-[40px] font-black text-white leading-none tracking-tight">VPN</div>
      <div class="text-[10px] text-white/70 uppercase tracking-[.12em] mt-1">Tailscale Mesh</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── PROXMOX CLUSTER ── -->
  <section class="border-b-3 border-black">
    <div class="px-10 pt-16 pb-0">
    <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Primary Infrastructure</p>
    <h2 class="text-[32px] font-black uppercase tracking-tight border-b-3 border-black pb-5 mb-0 inline-block">Proxmox Cluster</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 border-t-3 border-black mt-10">

      <div class="border-r-3 border-b-3 border-black p-10">
        <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">On-Demand Node</p>
        <h3 class="text-[17px] font-black uppercase mb-3">AMD Ryzen 5600</h3>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">Powered on when I need more compute than the 24/7 tier can offer — heavier VMs, extra staging environments, or a burst of build capacity. Also runs as a remote gaming server via Apollo/Artemis when it's up.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 border border-gray-300 px-2.5 py-1 tracking-[.04em]">Proxmox VE</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 border border-gray-300 px-2.5 py-1 tracking-[.04em]">Apollo</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 border border-gray-300 px-2.5 py-1 tracking-[.04em]">Artemis</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-r-3 border-b-3 border-black p-10">
        <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">24/7 Nodes × 2</p>
        <h3 class="text-[17px] font-black uppercase mb-3">Mac Mini 2012</h3>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">Two repurposed Mac Minis, always on. A dedicated high-availability remote development server, a GitHub Actions runner, Jellyfin, and ephemeral VMs for CTF setups and one-off testing.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 border border-gray-300 px-2.5 py-1 tracking-[.04em]">Proxmox VE</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 border border-gray-300 px-2.5 py-1 tracking-[.04em]">GitHub Actions Runner (act)</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 border border-gray-300 px-2.5 py-1 tracking-[.04em]">Jellyfin</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 border border-gray-300 px-2.5 py-1 tracking-[.04em]">LXC Containers</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-b-3 border-black p-10">
        <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Quorum Device</p>
        <h3 class="text-[17px] font-black uppercase mb-3">Raspberry Pi</h3>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">Not a full cluster node — the Pi runs as a Proxmox QDevice, giving the cluster a tie-breaking vote so quorum survives even with an even node count. It also carries its own always-on service stack below.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 border border-gray-300 px-2.5 py-1 tracking-[.04em]">Proxmox QDevice</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 border border-gray-300 px-2.5 py-1 tracking-[.04em]">Tailscale</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── RASPBERRY PI ── -->
  <section class="border-b-3 border-black">
    <div class="px-10 pt-16 pb-0">
    <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Always-On Services</p>
    <h2 class="text-[32px] font-black uppercase tracking-tight border-b-3 border-black pb-5 mb-0 inline-block">Raspberry Pi</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 border-t-3 border-black mt-10">

      <div class="border-r-3 border-b-3 border-black p-8">
        <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Storage</p>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-black uppercase mb-2">OpenMediaVault</h3>
        <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">DIY NAS. Central storage for the homelab, backing Jellyfin and Transmission downloads on the Mac Minis.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-r-3 border-b-3 border-black p-8">
        <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Network</p>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-black uppercase mb-2">Pi-hole</h3>
        <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Network-level ad and tracker blocking for every device on the home network. Doubles as a local DNS resolver.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-r-3 border-b-3 border-black p-8">
        <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Proxy</p>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-black uppercase mb-2">Nginx Proxy Manager</h3>
        <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Reverse proxy with automatic SSL for all internal services. Clean subdomains without exposing port numbers.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-b-3 border-black p-8">
        <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Containers</p>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-black uppercase mb-2">Portainer</h3>
        <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Container management UI for deploying and monitoring Docker services without full orchestration overhead.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-r-3 border-t-3 border-b-3 border-black p-8">
        <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Surveillance</p>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-black uppercase mb-2">Frigate</h3>
        <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">IP camera recording and motion detection. Local storage, no cloud subscription.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-r-3 border-t-3 border-b-3 border-black p-8">
        <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Downloads</p>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-black uppercase mb-2">Transmission</h3>
        <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Torrent client with a web UI. Downloads land on the OpenMediaVault share, picked up by Jellyfin automatically.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-r-3 border-t-3 border-b-3 border-black p-8">
        <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Monitoring</p>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-black uppercase mb-2">Jellystat</h3>
        <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Watch-history and usage stats for Jellyfin. Who's watching what, and how the media server is actually used.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t-3 border-b-3 border-black p-8">
        <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest2 mb-3">Automation</p>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-black uppercase mb-2">Home Assistant</h3>
        <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Home automation hub tying together smart devices around the house into one dashboard and rule engine.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
    </div>

    <a href="/blog.html" class="block border-t-3 border-black">
      <div class="px-10 py-5 flex items-center justify-between hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-colors group">
        <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.1em]">Read my posts on running this setup</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-bold group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  
</Base>
